{"Display", "显示"},
{"Unlocked", "解锁"},
{"Aspect ratio", "画面比例"},
{"Unlocked fills the window and shows more of the island on wide screens, up to ultrawide. Original keeps the game's 16:9 view with bars.", "“解锁”会填满窗口，在宽屏上能看到更多岛上的景色，最宽支持超宽屏。“原版”保持游戏的16:9画面并加黑边。"},
{"Fullscreen", "全屏"},
