{"Match display", "匹配显示器"},
{"Dynamic", "动态"},
{"How sharp the 3D image is. Match display uses your screen's resolution, and Dynamic goes as sharp as your GPU can at full speed. 1x to 4x multiply the Switch's 1080p, and 1x is 720p on this GPU. 75%%, 50%% and 25%% are for slower machines.\n\nRendering at %.0f x %.0f.", "3D画面的清晰度。“匹配显示器”使用屏幕的分辨率，“动态”会在保持全速的前提下尽量提高清晰度。1x到4x是Switch的1080p的倍数，在此GPU上1x为720p。75%%、50%%和25%%适合性能较低的电脑。\n\n当前渲染分辨率%.0f x %.0f。"},
{"How sharp the 3D image is. Match display uses your screen's resolution, and Dynamic goes as sharp as your GPU can at full speed. 1x to 4x multiply the Switch's 1080p. 75%%, 50%% and 25%% are for slower machines.\n\nRendering at %.0f x %.0f.", "3D画面的清晰度。“匹配显示器”使用屏幕的分辨率，“动态”会在保持全速的前提下尽量提高清晰度。1x到4x是Switch的1080p的倍数。75%%、50%%和25%%适合性能较低的电脑。\n\n当前渲染分辨率%.0f x %.0f。"},
{"Dynamic is at %.0f%% of the display right now.", "“动态”当前为显示器的%.0f%%。"},
{"Internal resolution", "内部分辨率"},
{"Bilinear", "双线性"},
