{"All dungeon items", "所有迷宫道具"},
{"Keysanity", "钥匙随机"},
{"Dungeon keys can be anywhere. The last choice does this for every dungeon item.", "迷宫钥匙可能在任何地方。最后一个选项对所有迷宫道具都生效。"},
{"Potsanity", "壶随机"},
{"Every pot you can lift in houses, caves and dungeons hides an item, about 400 more checks. Pots you haven't checked yet are golden.", "房屋、洞窟和迷宫中每个能举起的壶都藏着道具，增加约400个检查点。还没检查过的壶是金色的。"},
{"Vanilla prices", "原版价格"},
{"Random prices", "随机价格"},
{"Shopsanity", "商店随机"},
{"Everything in the Mabe Village shop is a check.", "梅贝村商店的每件商品都是检查点。"},
{"Stealing", "偷窃"},
{"Turns on or off the ability to steal.", "开启或关闭偷窃。"},
{"Fast Stealing", "快速偷窃"},
{"Fast Stealing doesn't require the Sword.", "快速偷窃不需要剑。"},
{"Trendy Game prizes", "流行游戏奖品"},
{"Each of the 5 crane prize spots holds a check. Once you win one, it goes back to normal prizes.", "抓娃娃机的5个奖品位置各有一个检查点。抓到后就恢复为普通奖品。"},
{"Fishing prizes", "钓鱼奖品"},
{"The fishing pond's prizes hold items from the pool.", "钓鱼池的奖品为道具池中的道具。"},
{"Rapids race prizes", "急流泛舟奖品"},
{"The Rapids Ride race's prizes hold items from the pool.", "急流泛舟竞速的奖品为道具池中的道具。"},
{"Dampe's rewards", "丹培的奖励"},
{"Dampe's Chamber Dungeon challenge rewards hold items from the pool.", "丹培的嵌板迷宫考验奖励为道具池中的道具。"},
{"Trade Quest Items", "交换道具"},
{"Progression can lie behind the Trade Quest.", "关键道具可能藏在交换任务之后。"},
{"Color Dungeon Blupees", "衣服迷宫的蓝卢比怪"},
{"The Color Dungeon's Blupees hold items from the pool.", "衣服迷宫的蓝卢比怪掉落道具池中的道具。"},
{"Entrance randomizer", "入口随机"},
{"Shuffles where entrances lead, with logic.", "按逻辑打乱入口通往的地方。"},
{"Dungeon entrances", "迷宫入口"},
{"Dungeon entrances lead into other dungeons.", "迷宫入口会通往其他迷宫。"},
{"Houses & caves", "房屋与洞窟"},
{"Shuffles houses, caves and the caves that link two areas. Marin & Tarin's house and water entrances stay vanilla.", "打乱房屋、洞窟以及连接两个区域的洞窟。玛林和塔林的家及水中入口保持原样。"},
{"Decoupled entrances", "入口不对称"},
{"Leaving a house drops you outside a different door than the one you came in.", "离开房屋时，会从和进来时不同的门出去。"},
{"Keep at least one kind of entrance shuffled, or turn the entrance randomizer off.", "至少保留一种入口随机，否则请关闭入口随机。"},
{"Coupled", "对称"},
{"Decoupled", "不对称"},
{"Dungeon room shuffle", "迷宫房间随机"},
{"Experimental. Shuffles dungeon rooms, creating new layouts.", "实验性功能。打乱迷宫房间，组成新的布局。"},
{"Map tracks door connections", "地图记录门的连接"},
{"Letter pairs on the dungeon map show which doorways connect. A pair shows up once you've used either door, and you see them all once you have the map.", "迷宫地图上成对的字母标出哪些门相连。通过其中任意一扇门后就会显示，拿到地图后全部显示。"},
{"Shuffle instruments", "乐器随机"},
{"The Siren Instruments are items in the pool instead of each dungeon's reward.", "瑟莲的乐器会放入道具池，而不是作为各迷宫的奖励。"},
{"Open Mabe Village", "开放梅贝村"},
{"Mabe Village's paths are open from the start.", "梅贝村的道路一开始就是通的。"},
{"Randomize enemies", "敌人随机"},
{"Shuffles enemies around the island.", "打乱岛上的敌人。"},
{"Seeded", "按种子"},
{"Mode", "模式"},
{"Seeded keeps enemies the same every time. Random rerolls them whenever an area loads.", "“按种子”每次的敌人都相同。“随机”每次读取区域时都会重新随机。"},
{"Include mini-bosses", "包括中首领"},
{"Mini-bosses join the normal enemy pool. Only some appear indoors, since the rest don't behave well in small rooms.", "中首领会加入普通敌人池。室内只会出现部分中首领，因为其他的在小房间里表现不正常。"},
{"Double", "两倍"},
{"All", "全部"},
{"Mini-boss frequency", "中首领频率"},
{"How often overworld enemies turn into mini-bosses. All swaps every enemy that has room.", "野外敌人变成中首领的频率。“全部”会替换所有空间足够的敌人。"},
{"Boss souls", "首领之魂"},
{"Each boss has a soul hidden in the item pool, Color Dungeon included. The boss won't show up until you find its soul, so that instrument stays locked. Found souls show on the Items screen.", "每个首领（包括衣服迷宫）的魂都藏在道具池中。找到魂之前首领不会出现，对应的乐器也拿不到。找到的魂会显示在道具画面上。"},
{"Mini-boss souls", "中首领之魂"},
{"Each kind of mini-boss has a soul hidden in the item pool. Without it, that mini-boss won't show up and its room stays shut. One soul covers every fight with that kind.", "每种中首领的魂都藏在道具池中。没有魂，该中首领不会出现，房间也打不开。一个魂对该种中首领的所有战斗都有效。"},
{"The Flying Rooster is an item. Once you find him he follows you, and the logic lets him stand in for Roc's Feather or the Hookshot.", "飞天鸡是道具。找到后会跟着你，逻辑上可以代替洛克鸟的羽毛或钩索。"},
{"The Ghost is an item. Once you find him, walk him to his grave for a check. He won't show up on his own after the Surf Harp.", "鬼怪是道具。找到后带他去他的坟墓即可获得一个检查点。拿到浪涛竖琴后他不会自己出现。"},
{"Companions allowed in dungeons", "同伴可进入迷宫"},
{"Companions follow Link into dungeons, and the logic counts on what they can do there, like the Flying Rooster standing in for Roc's Feather.", "同伴会跟着林克进入迷宫，逻辑会考虑他们在迷宫中的作用，比如飞天鸡可以代替洛克鸟的羽毛。"},
{"Weather Cycle", "天气循环"},
{"Adds a weather cycle, including storm and blizzard hazards.", "加入天气循环，包括暴风雨和暴风雪的危险。"},
{"Randomize music", "音乐随机"},
{"Shuffles the game's music.", "打乱游戏的音乐。"},
{"Randomize Cosmetics", "外观随机"},
{"Randomizes cosmetics to the seed.", "按种子随机外观。"},
{"Randomized Game Environments", "环境随机"},
{"The game has many built-in room shaders, like the desert, the Egg and the Mysterious Woods, some of them unused. The seed gives each area a random one.", "游戏内置了许多房间着色效果，比如沙漠、圣蛋和不可思议森林，其中一些没有用过。种子会为每个区域随机选一种。"},
{"Hints", "提示"},
{"Owl statues and phone booths give hints.", "猫头鹰石像和电话亭会给出提示。"},
{"Fast songs", "快速学曲"},
{"Learning a song skips its cutscene.", "学习乐曲时跳过过场动画。"},
{"Boss cutscenes", "首领过场动画"},
{"Plays each boss's intro cutscene.", "播放每个首领的登场动画。"},
{"Spoiler log", "剧透日志"},
{"Saves a list of where every item is. Open it from the seed's Spoiler log.", "保存所有道具位置的列表。可以从种子的“剧透日志”打开。"},
{"Race mode", "竞速模式"},
{"Locks the spoiler log until the credits and shows a seed hash on the title screen, so racers can check they're on the same seed.", "在制作人员名单之前锁定剧透日志，并在标题画面显示种子哈希，方便参赛者确认用的是同一个种子。"},
{"Your options", "你的选项"},
{"Seed ID", "种子ID"},
{"Easy", "简单"},
{"Dungeon items from the start, no traps, Mabe Village open, 200 rupees.", "一开始就有迷宫道具，无陷阱，梅贝村开放，200卢比。"},
{"Standard", "标准"},
{"The default options, plus hints and chests that match their contents.", "默认选项，另加提示和对应内容的宝箱外观。"},
{"Hard", "困难"},
{"Keysanity, shuffled entrances, rooms and instruments, random enemies, boss souls.", "钥匙随机，入口、房间和乐器随机，敌人随机，首领之魂。"},
{"Chaos", "混沌"},
{"Every extra check and every shuffle.", "所有额外检查点和所有随机。"},
